  "notes": "Source tables are from Exhibit C (pages 115-119) for all five divisions. The target grid requires average salary by age and service. The source tables provide Valuation Payroll (total dollars) and Number of Members (counts) by age and service. Average salary is derived as Payroll/Count using derive=ratio. The row_map uses sum for merged age bins (<25, 64, 70) because the derive operation (ratio) will compute the average after summing the totals and counts. The col_map copies source service bins to target bins; note that the target '34' and '40' both map to the source '30 +' bin as the source has no finer granularity for high service years. The '30 +' bin is used for both target columns as per the instruction to copy from a coarser source bin to each covered target bin.",
